            <TextArea layoutX="13.0" layoutY="34.0" prefHeight="289.0" prefWidth="314.0" text="The Search Appointment section allows you to find &#10;previously registered appointments and view their &#10;details.&#10;&#10;How to Search an Appointment&#10;Click Search Appointment from the menu.&#10;Enter the required Appointment Number.&#10;Click Search.&#10;The system will display the related appointment &#10;information, including:&#10;&#10;Appointment No&#10;Patient Name&#10;Address&#10;Contact No&#10;Dentist Name&#10;Treatment Type&#10;Payment Status&#10;Edit an Appointment&#10;&#10;After searching for an appointment:&#10;&#10;Change the required information.&#10;Click EDIT.&#10;The updated information will be saved.&#10;Delete an Appointment&#10;Search for the required appointment.&#10;Verify that it is the correct appointment.&#10;Click Delete to remove the appointment.&#10;&#10;Be careful when deleting an appointment because &#10;the selected appointment information may be &#10;permanently removed." />
